<h2 id="fort-collins-kitchen-design-trends">Fort Collins Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>Fort Collins kitchens favor warm transitional design — painted perimeters with stained islands, modern-shaker doors, and natural-wood accents that suit the area's mix of historic Old Town homes and newer construction. The region's growth keeps semi-custom value in demand, while higher-end remodels increasingly add <a href="/playbook/modern-inset">inset</a> and clean <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> construction.</p>
